Víceřádkové konstrukce
**********************

.[perex]
Sekce `multiline` rozhoduje o konstrukcích rozepsaných na víc řádků: signatuře, volání, poli, podmínce, řetězu volání a ternárním operátoru, o tom, kam se při zalomení řádku dává operátor, a o čárce za poslední položkou víceřádkového seznamu.

Konstrukce je rozepsaná, když se v ní láme řádek, ať ji tak napsal autor, nebo ji zlomila délka řádku. Hodnota `perLine` pak dá každé položce vlastní řádek a závorkám taky; PER Coding Style to chce u signatury, volání, podmínky, řetězu i pole. Signaturu delší než [`file.maxLineLength` |file#file.maxLineLength] zlomí `signatureOverMaxLength`, podmínku na příliš širokém řádku `condition`. A každé místo, kde stojí seznam, má vlastní klíč pro čárku na konci: pole, argumenty, parametry, větve `match`, `use` u closure, skupinový import a `list()`.

```neon
multiline:
	signature: perLine
	call: perLine
	array: perLine
	condition: perLine
	operatorPosition:
		condition: lineStart
	trailingComma:
		parameter: required
		argument: required
		array: required
```

```php .[before]
class Cart
{
	public function __construct(private Clock $clock,  // Expected a line break before the parameter, because the signature spans several lines.
		private Logger $logger, private Tax $tax)  // A multi-line parameter list must end with a trailing comma.
	{
	}

	public function add(string $name, int $count): void
	{
		$this->logger->log('added', [
			'name' => $name, 'count' => $count,  // Expected a line break before the array item, because the array spans several lines.
			'time' => $this->clock->now()]);  // A multi-line array must end with a trailing comma.
		if ($count > 10 &&  // Expected a line break before the expression, because the condition is not in the `perLine` shape.
			$name !== '') {
			$this->tax->apply($name,  // Expected a line break before the argument, because the arguments span several lines.
				$count);  // A multi-line argument list must end with a trailing comma.
		}
	}
}
```

```php .[after]
class Cart
{
	public function __construct(
		private Clock $clock,
		private Logger $logger,
		private Tax $tax,
	)
	{
	}

	public function add(string $name, int $count): void
	{
		$this->logger->log('added', [
			'name' => $name,
			'count' => $count,
			'time' => $this->clock->now(),
		]);
		if (
			$count > 10
			&& $name !== ''
		) {
			$this->tax->apply(
				$name,
				$count,
			);
		}
	}
}
```

Ukázka nastavuje jen sekci `multiline`, a proto `{` konstruktoru zůstala, kde byla; kam patří, rozhoduje [`braces.afterMultilineSignature` |braces#braces.afterMultilineSignature]. Řádky, které rozepsáním vzniknou, odsadí sekce [indentation |indentation].


Čárka na konci seznamu
======================

Čárka za poslední položkou víceřádkového seznamu má praktický důvod: přidání další položky změní v diffu jeden řádek, ne dva. U `required` rozhoduje zavírací závorka: když stojí na vlastním řádku, čárka tam patří, když stojí na řádku poslední položky, čárka tam být nesmí. `optional` ji nechá na autorovi, `forbidden` ji odstraní. Ze seznamu na jednom řádku se čárka odstraní při každé z těch tří hodnot, jen `keep` nechá daný druh seznamu úplně být.

```neon
multiline:
	trailingComma:
		array: required
```

```php .[before]
$colors = [
	'red',
	'green'
];  // A multi-line array must end with a trailing comma.

$sizes = ['S', 'M', 'L',];  // A one-line list must not end with a trailing comma.

$matrix = [
	[1, 2],
	[3, 4],];  // A trailing comma must not precede a closing bracket on the line of the last item.
```

```php .[after]
$colors = [
	'red',
	'green',
];

$sizes = ['S', 'M', 'L'];

$matrix = [
	[1, 2],
	[3, 4]];
```

Poslední případ ukazuje, kdo rozhoduje: pole je rozepsané na řádky, ale jeho zavírací závorka stojí na řádku poslední položky, takže tam čárka nepatří. Přesunout závorku na vlastní řádek je práce klíče `multiline.array`; teprve pak sem čárka přijde.


multiline.array
===============

The items of an array spread over lines, by its author or for its width, the opening bracket staying on the line of the code before it.

- `perLine`: every item on a line of its own and the closing bracket on a line of its own
- `asWritten`: the items stand as their author spread them, the opening bracket staying on the line before and each comma with its item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `asWritten`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.arrayOverWidth
========================

The width from bracket to bracket over which an array of several items written on one line is spread over lines, more than five items filling its lines where `array` is `asWritten`.

- počet od 1
- `none`: never spread for its width

Parametr, výchozí `none` · standardy: perCs `none`, psr12 `none`, nette `130`, symfony `none` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.array
=============================

The trailing comma of a multi-line array, a destructuring written with `[...]` included, which a list on one line never has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `required` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline`, `trailing_comma_in_multiline`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Arrays.TrailingArrayComma` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.argument
================================

The trailing comma of the multi-line arguments of a call and the variables of `isset()` and `unset()`, which a list on one line never has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `optional` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Functions.RequireTrailingCommaInCall` .[decision-facts]

```neon
multiline:
	trailingComma:
		argument: required
```

```php .[before]
mail(
	$to,
	$subject
);  // A multi-line argument list must end with a trailing comma.
```

```php .[after]
mail(
	$to,
	$subject,
);
```


multiline.trailingComma.parameter
=================================

The trailing comma of a multi-line list of parameters, which a list on one line never has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `required` · pokrývá `function_declaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Functions.RequireTrailingCommaInDeclaration` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.matchArm
================================

The trailing comma of the arms of a multi-line `match`, which a list on one line never has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `required` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.closureUse
==================================

The trailing comma of a multi-line `use` of a closure, which a list on one line never has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.import
==============================

The trailing comma of the names of a multi-line group use, which a list on one line never has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `optional`, psr12 `keep`, nette `optional`, symfony `optional` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.list
============================

The trailing comma of a multi-line `list()`, which a list on one line never has.

- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `optional`, psr12 `keep`, nette `optional`, symfony `optional` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline` .[decision-facts]


multiline.condition
===================

The shape of a condition of `if`, `elseif`, `while` and `do-while` joined by boolean operators that stands on several lines or on one too wide, the closing parenthesis on a line of its own; one in no shape that passes is written again in the first, a line per part beginning with its operator.

- `perLine`: begins on the line after the opening parenthesis
- `compact`: begins on the line of the opening parenthesis
- seznam těchto slov, kde projde každé a kód, který neodpovídá žádnému, se napíše podle prvního
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `[perLine, compact]`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `PSR12.ControlStructures.ControlStructureSpacing`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.RequireMultiLineCondition` .[decision-facts]

Nette Coding Standard připouští oba tvary, podmínku začínající na dalším řádku i tu, která začíná hned za závorkou:

```neon
multiline:
	condition: [perLine, compact]
```

```php .[before]
if ($order->isPaid()
	&& $order->isShipped()
) {
	archive($order);
}

if (
	$order->isPaid()
	&& $order->isShipped()
) {
	archive($order);
}
```


multiline.operatorPosition.condition
====================================

Where a boolean operator chaining a condition of `if`, `elseif`, `while` and `do-while` stands at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `lineStart`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `PSR12.ControlStructures.BooleanOperatorPlacement` .[decision-facts]


multiline.operatorPosition.binary
=================================

Where a binary operator other than `.` stands at a line break, a boolean operator chaining a condition apart: a comparison, a bitwise operator or a shift moves only where the line joined after it would be too wide.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `lineStart`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.operatorPosition.concatenation
========================================

Where the concatenation operator stands at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `keep`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.chain
===============

The links of a chain of method calls and property accesses spread over lines.

- `perLine`: every link on a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.chainFirstLinks
=========================

Where the links stand that come before the first one beginning a line.

- `ownLine`: the first link begins a line too
- `startLine`: the links before the first one beginning a line stay on the line the chain starts on

Parametr, výchozí `ownLine` · standardy: perCs `ownLine`, psr12 `ownLine`, nette `startLine`, symfony `ownLine` .[decision-facts]


multiline.ternary
=================

A ternary spread over lines.

- `perLine`: `?` and `:` each opening a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.operatorPosition.ternary
==================================

Where `?`, `:` and `?:` of a ternary stand at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `keep`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.call
==============

The arguments of a call spread over lines, which is one where an argument or the closing parenthesis begins a line, the closing parenthesis then standing on a line of its own and each comma on the line of its argument.

- `perLine`: every argument on a line of its own
- `frame`: only the parentheses on lines of their own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `method_argument_space`, `PSR2.Methods.FunctionCallSignature` .[decision-facts]


multiline.signatureOverMaxLength
================================

A signature on a line longer than the maximum is spread over lines.

- `split`: every parameter on a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `split`, psr12 `split`, nette `split`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.RequireMultiLineMethodSignature` .[decision-facts]


multiline.constructorWithPromotedProperties
===========================================

A signature declaring a promoted property.

- `split`: spread over lines whatever its length
- `asSignature`: spread only when its line is too long, as any signature

Parametr, výchozí `split` · standardy: perCs `asSignature`, psr12 `asSignature`, nette `split`, symfony `asSignature` · pokrývá `multiline_promoted_properties`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.RequireMultiLineMethodSignature` .[decision-facts]


multiline.signature
===================

The parameters of a signature spread over lines, or with a parameter whose hooks span lines, each comma on the line of its parameter and the closing parenthesis on the next.

- `perLine`: every parameter on a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.RequireMultiLineMethodSignature`, `Squiz.Functions.MultiLineFunctionDeclaration` .[decision-facts]


multiline.attributes
====================

The attributes of a class, a function, a method, a property, a constant or a case of an enum stand right above it, no blank line between the groups; those of a closure or an anonymous class may share its line.

- `ownLines`: every group on a line of its own above the declaration
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `ownLines`, psr12 `keep`, nette `ownLines`, symfony `ownLines` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Attributes.DisallowMultipleAttributesPerLine` .[decision-facts]


multiline.parameterAttributes
=============================

Where the attributes of a parameter stand.

- `ownLines`: every group on a line of its own in a list of parameters spread over lines, on the line of the parameter in a list on one line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `ownLines`, psr12 `keep`, nette `ownLines`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Attributes.DisallowMultipleAttributesPerLine` .[decision-facts]


multiline.expressionBelowReturn
===============================

An expression spanning several lines begins on the line of `return`, `throw`, `yield`, `print` or `echo`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.semicolonOnOwnLine
============================

A semicolon standing on a line of its own below a statement spanning several lines, instead of closing its last line.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `Squiz.WhiteSpace.SemicolonSpacing` .[decision-facts]
